WEBVTT

00:08.360 --> 00:10.870
DAY 84

00:16.370 --> 00:17.330
Who are you?!

00:17.330 --> 00:20.380
Oh, good morning, dear brother.

00:20.380 --> 00:26.970
Your sleeping face was so defenseless
I couldn't keep my eyes away from it.

00:26.970 --> 00:28.510
Hobfu?!

00:29.010 --> 00:32.930
The amount of experience we gained
from the last battle was so much...

00:32.930 --> 00:36.140
...that a lot of people evolved.

00:37.520 --> 00:39.010
At least wipe off your drool...

02:14.990 --> 02:20.750
What do you think of this outfit, Ogrou?
Does it suit me?

02:21.090 --> 02:24.620
Hobji, who tried his best
to heal the wounded at our base,

02:24.620 --> 02:27.210
has evolved into a Half Saint Lord.

02:30.840 --> 02:33.260
It's all right now.

02:33.260 --> 02:36.700
Besides that,
he also gained this ability.

02:37.260 --> 02:40.180
This light membrane called Shell Field...

02:40.180 --> 02:44.020
...is a unique skill of a Half Saint Lord.

02:44.370 --> 02:45.980
Even without other abilities,

02:45.980 --> 02:50.780
it's a tough barrier that takes
twenty of my punches to break.

02:50.780 --> 02:56.950
Aw... Hobji's balance between
cute and cool is perfect.

02:56.950 --> 03:00.410
Oh, maybe his name
will change too?

03:00.410 --> 03:01.670
On the other hand,

03:01.670 --> 03:06.540
this Hobfu, who loves spoiled meat,
turned into a ghoul.

03:06.540 --> 03:10.550
Since she kept eating
the zombies I created,

03:10.550 --> 03:12.920
I knew this would happen.

03:14.170 --> 03:15.930
Oh my, Ogrekichi.

03:16.340 --> 03:20.640
A mainstream dynamic between dear brothers
who elevate each other is the best!

03:20.640 --> 03:25.350
Ah, but a pairing of handsome brothers
with different body sizes isn't bad either.

03:26.060 --> 03:27.600
Hold on a second.

03:27.600 --> 03:31.110
What is she thinking about...

03:31.110 --> 03:34.320
...while comparing me,
Hobji, and Ogrekichi?

03:34.320 --> 03:36.770
I think I shouldn't ask her more...

03:38.870 --> 03:40.780
Sorry, Hobme.

03:40.780 --> 03:43.660
Could you close your other eyes
besides the ones on your face?

03:43.660 --> 03:47.330
S-Sorry!
I'm still not used to this...

03:47.330 --> 03:51.290
In exchange for Hobme's
lack of face-to-face combat,

03:51.290 --> 03:54.630
she evolved into a race
that excels in sorcery,

03:54.630 --> 03:55.880
a Dodomeki.

03:57.300 --> 04:01.600
Her Remote Viewing
and Introscopy ability...

04:01.600 --> 04:05.890
...are abilities that collect information
way better than I can ever do.

04:06.600 --> 04:07.310
HOBJI CHANGE TO SEIJI
Let's see...

04:07.310 --> 04:08.020
HOBME CHANGE TO DODOME
Let's see...

04:08.020 --> 04:09.020
HOBFU CHANGE TO GOULFU
Let's see...

04:09.020 --> 04:10.020
Huh?

04:11.270 --> 04:12.270
If you are wondering...

04:12.270 --> 04:14.730
GOULFU -> GOULROTTEN
...why Goulfu's name changed into "rotten,"

04:14.730 --> 04:15.990
GOULFU -> GOULROTTEN
it's not a misspell.

04:15.990 --> 04:17.030
GOULFU -> GOULROTTEN

04:17.470 --> 04:21.030
Following that, the seven hobgoblins
who served as servants...

04:21.030 --> 04:23.280
...all ranked up into ogre.

04:24.330 --> 04:28.660
Ogrou, please continue to train us
so we can grow stronger.

04:28.660 --> 04:31.540
We'll strive to become stronger
for our fallen comrade!

04:31.930 --> 04:34.230
Nevertheless, it's strange...

04:34.230 --> 04:38.090
Goblins are typically selfish,
yet they mourn their fallen comrade,

04:38.090 --> 04:41.340
channeling their sorrow
into strength to press onward.

04:42.720 --> 04:45.720
Furthermore, six Fleet Foot Kobolds
have joined our ranks,

04:45.720 --> 04:47.600
bringing the total to seven―

04:47.600 --> 04:48.430
Wait...

04:49.440 --> 04:51.190
Where is your leader?

04:51.590 --> 04:54.070
Right here, my lord.

04:54.070 --> 04:57.570
Their leader has become a Genin Kobold.

04:57.910 --> 05:03.820
Now that I have evolved, my appearance
is similar to that of my lord and others.

05:03.820 --> 05:04.910
However...

05:04.910 --> 05:10.580
No matter how you look at it, he resembles
an old man cosplaying as a yakuza.

05:10.580 --> 05:13.790
After attaining this form,

05:13.790 --> 05:17.090
I have gained a True Name.

05:17.090 --> 05:21.340
From now on, please address me
as Akikazenotsuji.

05:21.340 --> 05:26.140
TRUE NAME
True Name is a special name bestowed upon...

05:26.140 --> 05:28.350
TRUE NAME
...achieving a certain level of evolution.

05:28.710 --> 05:32.230
Thus, if others become aware of it,

05:32.230 --> 05:35.860
you cannot escape curses
or similar consequences.

05:35.860 --> 05:36.900
In simpler terms,

05:36.900 --> 05:42.610
revealing your true name to others
is akin to inviting disaster.

05:43.160 --> 05:45.620
Inviting one? By whom?

05:46.010 --> 05:51.210
But this is merely a ceremonial gesture
to pledge my loyalty to you, my lord.

05:51.210 --> 05:52.870
O-Okay...

05:53.320 --> 05:56.920
In the end, I'm the one
who decides what to call him.

05:56.920 --> 06:00.380
So, from now on,
I'll refer to him as Akita.

06:00.790 --> 06:03.880
Now, what should I do
with the prisoners...

06:04.640 --> 06:07.140
And then today's problem occurred.

06:07.570 --> 06:11.310
Uh... So you're all free now.

06:11.310 --> 06:14.350
You can go wherever you want, but...

06:14.350 --> 06:18.900
For those of you who have nowhere else to go,
you can stay here as temporary members.

06:18.900 --> 06:20.650
This is unacceptable!

06:21.090 --> 06:24.910
We're clearly superior
to everyone else here,

06:24.910 --> 06:28.160
so why are we only temporary members?!

06:28.160 --> 06:32.160
Yeah! I won't accept being ranked
lower than a goblin!

06:32.160 --> 06:33.040
Huh?!

06:33.040 --> 06:34.120
What did you say?!

06:34.120 --> 06:35.920
Don't get too cocky!

06:35.920 --> 06:36.960
- You dare to look down on us, huh?

06:36.960 --> 06:38.630
- It's true that these guys
- You dare to look down on us, huh?

06:38.630 --> 06:41.050
- are stronger than hobgoblins,
- How cocky. If you think you can,

06:41.050 --> 06:42.170
- but compared to the newcomers...
- then prove it!

06:42.170 --> 06:44.180
- ...I brought here just a few days ago,
- We won't accept such treatment!

06:44.180 --> 06:47.790
I have more faith in the goblins
who have trained here.

06:49.390 --> 06:51.930
If you have any complaints,
you can leave, you know?

06:53.180 --> 06:56.440
You're leaving me no choice.
We want to propose something too.

06:57.060 --> 06:59.940
Let us fight the leader
of those mercenaries!

07:00.430 --> 07:04.700
If we win, we'll take charge here!

07:06.610 --> 07:08.010
Oh, come on.

07:08.010 --> 07:11.950
I thought that dhampir woman
was the leader.

07:11.950 --> 07:15.540
To think the ogre is the leader,
even though he's just a subspecies.

07:15.540 --> 07:18.710
Well, with this kind of mercenary,
it's kind of expected.

07:20.670 --> 07:23.460
Calm down, Dhami.

07:23.850 --> 07:27.840
In answer to you all being so confident,

07:27.840 --> 07:29.970
you two can attack me at once.

07:30.720 --> 07:33.100
Don't get ahead of yourself!

07:33.720 --> 07:38.980
I'll make you regret facing the Flame Lord
and the Gale Lord at the same time!

07:38.980 --> 07:40.860
Orb, release!

07:44.740 --> 07:46.280
Orb, release!

07:49.990 --> 07:53.290
Ohoho, excuse me, girls.

07:53.290 --> 07:55.500
Oh, an Orb Equipment.

07:55.500 --> 07:58.870
You two might be able to wield that,
so watch closely.

07:58.870 --> 08:02.380
Nothing compares to seeing it
with your own eyes.

08:03.000 --> 08:07.800
Orb Equipment rapidly enhances
the user's combat skills,

08:07.800 --> 08:10.640
and even if it breaks,
it can repair itself,

08:10.640 --> 08:13.560
which means I can crush their pride
without hesitation.

08:21.150 --> 08:21.900
Next!

08:27.110 --> 08:29.820
I'll leave these guys to you,

08:29.820 --> 08:31.820
so treat them well for me.

08:31.820 --> 08:33.330
'Kay.

08:38.330 --> 08:39.420
Ogrou!

08:39.420 --> 08:44.450
Did you see that?
That's the destructive power of my fist!

08:44.450 --> 08:47.670
From today,
I'll be the boss of this place!

08:54.760 --> 08:59.150
That was a nice surprise attack,
so I had to intentionally take it.

08:59.640 --> 09:04.190
Now, I'm sure there's
one half-dhampir left...

09:04.530 --> 09:11.570
If I win, as a reward I'll be your husband
instead of that filthy ogre.

09:11.570 --> 09:14.450
I'll refuse even if you beg me to.

09:17.040 --> 09:21.960
As if I would just forgive him for acting
like Dhami's lover in front of me.

09:24.250 --> 09:28.210
Even after doing this much to him,
he'll heal just by drinking blood,

09:28.210 --> 09:31.220
so I gave him a bit of mine.

09:32.010 --> 09:36.760
There are still many strong ones among
the provisional members, but...

09:36.760 --> 09:40.770
If we became your enemy, we couldn't repay
our debt for freeing us from slavery.

09:40.770 --> 09:42.470
I agree.

09:42.470 --> 09:44.760
You healed our wounds too, after all.

09:45.730 --> 09:51.240
I decided to offer them my best hospitality
because of their great understanding.

09:51.990 --> 09:54.780
All right, with this,
nobody has any complaints now, right?

09:54.780 --> 09:58.370
What is it? You want to go
for another round?

09:59.750 --> 10:05.500
Your blood is the sweetest and most
fragrant I've ever tasted in my life.

10:07.500 --> 10:11.220
You truly are my destined one.

10:14.590 --> 10:18.510
I'm fed up with that
because of Goulfu's delusion!

10:18.930 --> 10:22.520
With this, we've finalized the selection
of 50 provisional members.

10:25.480 --> 10:27.480
All right, let's do this!

10:27.480 --> 10:29.980
With this, you're done!

10:29.980 --> 10:31.990
I'll destroy you all!

10:32.350 --> 10:35.990
I'm entrusting their training to Ogrekichi.

10:36.490 --> 10:40.290
These are fresh recruits who will be
working together here starting today.

10:40.290 --> 10:44.000
You're the elemental smith, right?

10:44.000 --> 10:46.710
In terms of blacksmithing,
you still have room to improve,

10:46.710 --> 10:48.500
but your skills are not bad at all.

10:48.940 --> 10:52.420
To be honest, I'm not really
comfortable with these guys...

10:52.420 --> 10:57.660
But in this world, the dwarves'
blacksmithing skills are among the finest.

10:57.660 --> 11:02.520
And I want them to craft Mithril equipment,
so could you at least try to get along?

11:03.180 --> 11:05.690
I decided to conduct a synthesis experiment...

11:05.690 --> 11:09.400
...utilizing the ability
I acquired during yesterday's battle.

11:09.400 --> 11:11.610
Orb, release!

11:12.360 --> 11:13.030
Oh?

11:13.030 --> 11:15.530
Looks like there's no problem at all.

11:16.110 --> 11:20.280
Next, I attempted to summon a monster
using the Chaos of the Dead.

11:20.650 --> 11:23.250
However, the legion that emerged...

11:23.250 --> 11:25.920
...went berserk and refused
to obey my commands,

11:25.920 --> 11:27.330
so I promptly disposed of it.

11:27.960 --> 11:30.670
Lastly, I focused on developing
my synthesis ability.

11:30.670 --> 11:34.840
By combining Weakness to Sunlight
and Weakness to Light Damage,

11:34.840 --> 11:38.140
I obtained Weakness
to Holy Damage, but...

11:41.680 --> 11:43.970
Yeah, I'm going to seal this one.

11:44.430 --> 11:49.230
As I mentioned earlier, it's more taxing
on my mind than on my body.

11:50.230 --> 11:53.610
The test run for the synthesis ability
will take place tomorrow.

11:54.110 --> 11:56.610
DAY 85

11:57.320 --> 12:01.620
The following day, we focused on
enhancing the comfort of our base,

12:01.620 --> 12:04.370
particularly by improving
our hot spring facilities.

12:04.370 --> 12:06.870
THIS IS JUST AN IMAGINATION
Our primary objective is...

12:06.870 --> 12:07.710
...to establish trade with the elves.

12:07.710 --> 12:10.000
EFFICACY: FATIGUE/STRESS RELIEF,
...to establish trade with the elves.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.960
HEALTH IMPROVEMENT,
To begin with, I'll extend an invitation...

12:11.960 --> 12:14.050
NEURAL/MUSCLE PAIN RECOVERY,
...to the leader of the elven village,

12:14.050 --> 12:15.010
AND COLD SENSITIVE,
to showcase the appeal of our hot springs.

12:15.010 --> 12:16.630
SHOULDERS AND EXERCISE FATIGUE,
to showcase the appeal of our hot springs.

12:17.130 --> 12:19.640
DAY 86

12:19.640 --> 12:24.390
To ensure that no one is harmed
during the synthesis ability tests,

12:24.390 --> 12:27.140
I'm conducting them with
provisional members, but...

12:27.140 --> 12:28.640
Ah.

12:28.640 --> 12:30.690
I guess I went too far...

12:32.150 --> 12:34.650
DAY 87

12:35.070 --> 12:40.100
Sorry to disturb your nap,
but I have something for you.

12:40.700 --> 12:41.910
What's this?

12:41.910 --> 12:44.410
This is our finest product.

12:46.040 --> 12:48.410
From what I learned later,

12:48.410 --> 12:50.670
as a gesture of gratitude and friendship,

12:50.670 --> 12:53.920
they presented me with their
finest creation, the War Hammer.

12:53.920 --> 12:58.420
But much of what they said
was beyond my comprehension.

12:59.470 --> 13:02.010
At noon, I ventured alone
into the forest.

13:02.010 --> 13:03.930
Unlike when I was newly born,

13:03.930 --> 13:09.180
animals would scatter unless
I concealed my presence.

13:09.980 --> 13:12.190
It makes me feel lonely somehow.

13:12.560 --> 13:13.940
It's been a while.

13:13.940 --> 13:15.500
Ogrou.

13:16.320 --> 13:20.450
What should we do?
Dive into some fun right away?

13:20.820 --> 13:23.620
Uh, can we do that later?

13:23.620 --> 13:25.580
So, about the things that I asked you...

13:25.580 --> 13:28.450
Nope.

13:37.380 --> 13:40.720
After spending some time
together having fun,

13:41.130 --> 13:43.010
You've got some kiss marks again!

13:43.010 --> 13:45.720
Better prepare yourself tonight!

13:45.720 --> 13:49.730
And things are heating up
as the night goes...

13:50.230 --> 13:52.730
DAY 88

13:52.730 --> 13:56.690
As I mentioned earlier,
to boost our food self-sufficiency,

13:56.690 --> 13:59.230
we're going to cultivate
a field right here!

13:59.230 --> 14:03.240
I put a lot of effort into planting these,
so take good care of them, okay?

14:03.860 --> 14:06.370
The things I received from
the dryad yesterday...

14:06.370 --> 14:09.240
...are magic vegetable and fruit seeds.

14:09.240 --> 14:11.000
They're called magical seeds.

14:11.370 --> 14:16.170
They grow faster, are more nutritious,
and tastier than natural ones.

14:16.170 --> 14:20.210
I'll leave this job to those
who have agricultural abilities.

14:24.010 --> 14:27.010
I have the impression
that Ogrou can do anything.

14:27.010 --> 14:28.970
Is this your first time farming?

14:28.970 --> 14:32.520
It's refreshing that now
I'm the one teaching you.

14:32.940 --> 14:33.770
I guess...

14:33.770 --> 14:35.520
Everyone!

14:35.520 --> 14:38.270
Lunch is ready!

14:38.640 --> 14:43.780
Spending days doing healthy work
like this isn't bad at all.

14:44.280 --> 14:46.780
DAY 89

14:47.490 --> 14:52.290
Today, some of the provisional members
went back to their homeland.

14:53.160 --> 14:56.960
Aside from that, another group was headed
for the town, but among the group...

14:56.960 --> 14:59.550
...are nobles with positions.

14:59.890 --> 15:05.800
For Madam Dhami's sake...
For Madam Dhami's sake...

15:06.390 --> 15:09.560
Those guys are already
hypnotized by Dhami's evil eye.

15:09.560 --> 15:14.060
In other words, they'll act as spies
for the kingdom and the emperor.

15:14.750 --> 15:16.330
From the information
I've gathered,

15:16.330 --> 15:19.310
all of the human armies
are already retreating.

15:19.310 --> 15:21.570
So, we'll have them regroup there.

15:22.070 --> 15:26.820
The human armies are beginning
to withdraw. The war is over.

15:27.320 --> 15:32.620
That's why I'm inviting you
to Ruthruf's party as my dear friend.

15:47.640 --> 15:50.350
Is it okay for us to be invited to this?

15:50.350 --> 15:55.100
According to our laws, we're not allowed
to interact with outsiders of this forest.

15:55.100 --> 15:59.980
But you and your friends are
considered our "dear friends."

16:04.070 --> 16:06.150
It's an old story,

16:06.150 --> 16:09.820
but back then, my brother,
longing to interact with the outside world,

16:09.820 --> 16:12.740
broke the law and went
outside the forest.

16:13.910 --> 16:17.790
If the day comes
when he returns to this forest,

16:17.790 --> 16:22.250
what I can do is protect
this forest until that day arrives.

16:23.520 --> 16:27.260
Thanks to you,
it has become true,

16:27.260 --> 16:31.010
and I can keep waiting for that day.

16:46.280 --> 16:48.780
DAY 90

16:49.610 --> 16:51.010
When I returned to the base,

16:51.010 --> 16:54.530
Earthe had already dug up
some spirit stones.

16:54.930 --> 16:57.750
This is the biggest one so far...

16:57.750 --> 17:00.790
Litana, Velvet...

17:01.710 --> 17:06.420
In the first place, spirit stones are
the legacy of the magician Velvet.

17:06.420 --> 17:10.220
Because we encountered Litana,
the carbuncle who protected it,

17:10.220 --> 17:12.550
now it belongs to us.

17:13.470 --> 17:15.680
I expressed my gratitude to them,

17:15.680 --> 17:18.560
and I'll eat this afterward.

17:21.810 --> 17:23.900
ABILITY "PHOTON RULER" LEARNED
Photon Ruler, Tolerance Photon,

17:23.900 --> 17:24.930
ABILITY "PHOTON RESISTANCE" LEARNED
Photon Ruler, Tolerance Photon,

17:24.930 --> 17:27.030
ABILITY "GRAVITY LAW" LEARNED
Gravity Law, Tolerance Darkness

17:27.030 --> 17:28.570
ABILITY "DARK RESISTANCE" LEARNED
Gravity Law, Tolerance Darkness

17:28.570 --> 17:32.570
Following that, I initiated
large-scale production.

17:32.570 --> 17:37.330
This involved assembling the bones of
a substantial number of black skeletons.

17:37.750 --> 17:41.590
And when I infused them with my clones
for sunlight resistance...

17:46.210 --> 17:49.090
I dub it the Skeleton Centipede!

17:49.090 --> 17:50.590
What... is this?

17:50.590 --> 17:52.430
It's grotesque.

17:52.430 --> 17:54.590
And here I was thinking
it was a new familiar...

17:54.590 --> 17:56.720
Although...

17:56.720 --> 17:59.140
Rather than calling it a familiar,

17:59.140 --> 18:01.980
it's more like our transportation.

18:02.560 --> 18:04.730
We'll use this to reach the human town.

18:05.240 --> 18:08.700
Are you going to abandon us?

18:09.230 --> 18:13.820
"I will return you to the human town
one day." That was my first promise.

18:13.820 --> 18:17.240
Whether you want to stay here
or leave, it's up to you.

18:17.740 --> 18:20.250
DAY 91

18:20.250 --> 18:22.500
It's done!

18:22.500 --> 18:25.750
With this, the elves will be satisfied.

18:26.340 --> 18:29.130
And with this work completed,

18:29.130 --> 18:33.260
the remaining people who want to go back
to their homeland finally depart.

18:35.300 --> 18:39.810
What are you doing, dumb student?
Don't space out while holding a sword―

18:40.470 --> 18:41.980
What's wrong?

18:42.510 --> 18:46.750
Do I have to go back
to the human town?

18:49.150 --> 18:51.570
Like I know that, you idiot!

18:52.440 --> 18:53.570
But...

18:54.010 --> 18:58.940
From where I stand,
I doubt the boss will let you go so easily.

19:02.080 --> 19:04.580
DAY 92

19:05.000 --> 19:08.420
If we were in town, many of these
things would need to be bought.

19:08.420 --> 19:11.840
This forest is truly amazing.

19:11.840 --> 19:14.840
Let's gather whatever we can sell.

19:15.280 --> 19:17.590
Just not too much, okay?

19:18.510 --> 19:22.810
I'm truly grateful to have met these girls
who shared their wisdom with me.

19:22.810 --> 19:25.640
Especially since
I'm lacking in knowledge.

19:26.850 --> 19:29.360
DAY 93

19:29.860 --> 19:31.730
Since all the preparations are done today,

19:31.730 --> 19:36.030
I've decided to hold a party
to welcome the new members.

19:36.700 --> 19:40.030
Cheers!

19:41.870 --> 19:46.370
Hey, you!
Ogrou! Come here.

19:46.370 --> 19:51.380
You are planning to head to human town
with that centipede-thing, right?

19:51.380 --> 19:56.050
While you're away,
we'll do whatever we please.

19:56.050 --> 19:58.390
You're already drunk.

19:58.810 --> 20:02.430
But for a kingdom and empire
that despise demi-humans,

20:02.430 --> 20:06.890
there's a chance that they won't let you in
unless you have a Lord as a supervisor.

20:07.300 --> 20:11.150
That's it!
I'll be your supervisor.

20:11.150 --> 20:13.650
Heh, I don't need it.

20:14.150 --> 20:16.650
DAY 94

20:17.490 --> 20:22.410
The morning before departure,
we decided on the team members.

20:23.120 --> 20:24.410
Each of you has...

20:24.410 --> 20:26.500
1ST GROUP: OGROU (LEADER),
...four rules you must strictly adhere to.

20:26.500 --> 20:27.910
DHAMI, 5 HUMANS, 3 LORDS
First,

20:27.910 --> 20:29.250
2ND GROUP: OGREKICHI (LEADER 1),
you must gather information

20:29.250 --> 20:29.960
EARTHE (LEADER 2), 1 HOBGOBLIN CLERIC,
about the outside world.

20:29.960 --> 20:31.420
3 HUMANS, 4 FLEET FOOT KOBOLD
about the outside world.

20:31.420 --> 20:32.590
3RD GROUP: BLOODSATO (LEADER 1),
Second, if you run into trouble,

20:32.590 --> 20:33.380
SPELLSEI (LEADER 2), 3 ELVES, 1 HUMAN,
Second, if you run into trouble,

20:33.380 --> 20:34.920
3 HOBGOBLINS, 1 HOBGOBLIN CLERIC
you need to fix it yourselves.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.170
4TH GROUP: 2 OGRES,
you need to fix it yourselves.

20:36.170 --> 20:37.630
1 HOBGOBLIN MAGE, 2 ORORRIN,
Third,

20:37.630 --> 20:38.430
2 DRAGONEWT, 3 HUMANS
everyone needs to raise their levels.

20:38.430 --> 20:40.800
5TH GROUP: DODOME (LEADER), 5 OGRES,
everyone needs to raise their levels.

20:40.800 --> 20:41.930
2 HUMANS, 1 GENIN KOBOLD, 1 CENTAUR

20:41.930 --> 20:43.850
Fourth,

20:43.850 --> 20:45.930
do not die, no matter what.

20:46.430 --> 20:49.940
DAY 95
Finally, it is time to depart.

20:50.410 --> 20:52.690
I knew you'd take us too.

20:53.070 --> 20:56.320
Don't attack humans who aren't
doing anything, okay, Bloodsato?

20:56.320 --> 20:57.690
Okay, okay.

20:57.690 --> 21:03.870
I-I'll do my best not to be a burden.

21:03.870 --> 21:06.950
Let's give it our all.

21:08.870 --> 21:13.540
Don't worry,
I'll protect Seiji's innocence.

21:13.540 --> 21:16.070
No stealing any starts, okay?

21:18.170 --> 21:21.470
Ogrekichi, and the rest of you,
don't run off on your own, okay?

21:21.470 --> 21:23.930
Understood.
I'll do my best.

21:23.930 --> 21:26.310
You too, Ogrou.
Be careful, okay?

21:26.310 --> 21:27.220
Of course.

21:27.620 --> 21:30.980
Each group departs on different paths.

21:32.400 --> 21:35.980
I have to bid farewell to this
liveliness for a while, huh...

21:36.520 --> 21:41.570
I've lost many things while living here,
but I've gained more than I lost.

21:41.570 --> 21:44.910
A chance to meet a lot of extraordinary
people in an unusual place.

21:44.910 --> 21:47.950
But in this world,

21:47.950 --> 21:51.000
there are still many formidable things
I haven't encountered yet.

21:52.540 --> 21:53.500
Our destination...

21:53.930 --> 21:57.250
...is the place where these girls
I've met are heading.

21:57.250 --> 22:00.010
Garrison City, Trient.

23:30.010 --> 23:39.980
